* Feature 13, T4: Write-summary lens fixture
* Writes two distinct DDMs (CUSTOMER, ORDERS) via STORE.
* Also includes a record-form UPDATE (empty Name gap) to verify the gap is skipped.
*
* Expected DataAccessEntry output:
*   - Kind=EdgeWrites, Name="CUSTOMER", NameRange on "CUSTOMER" token
*   - Kind=EdgeWrites, Name="ORDERS", NameRange on "ORDERS" token
*   - Kind=EdgeWrites, Name="", NameRange on empty (record-form UPDATE)

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 ISN (P9.9)
END DEFINE

READ CUSTOMER
  UPDATE
END

STORE CUSTOMER

STORE ORDERS

END
